title: InvestigationBoard
tags:
---
<<if GetIsCompanionInParty($kieran) == true>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You watch Kieran attempt to keep focus as he inspects the chaos of the visual representation of your work.][/nomarkup]
    {$kieran}: I see your tenacity at work here. No wonder you were able to figure out the Pride. 
    {$kieran}: You're either a brilliant investigator... or a stalker in the making. #line:0333c8f
    -> {$pcName}: Thank you. #line:001277b
        {$kieran}: You're welcome. Now let's hope your skills are enough to save us both. #line:07e5918
        -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
    -> {$pcName}: This is where I keep track of UFO sightings. #line:08dba13
        {$kieran}: And yet, you did not see us coming. #line:0762700
        -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
    -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The board is cluttered, almost concerning to look at. A blank map of the city littered with push pins and scribbled notes from cases long past.][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The most recent additions are the overdue bills you've posted as fearful motivation.][/nomarkup]     
<<if GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Finance") <= 3>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You don't know much about budgeting and it shows.][/nomarkup]        
        -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
    <<else>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You have about a month - maybe two - of savings left.][/nomarkup]   #line:07febb4
        -> [nomarkup][Walk away.][/nomarkup]
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
